Great suggestion, thanks! Those attributes are great.  However, it doesn't work for `_containingDocument` because:
```csharp
        private void Initialize(XmlElement? element)
        {
            _containingDocument = (element == null ? null : element.OwnerDocument);
```

So, `_containingDocument` can be `null` if `element` is null.
